  "fullDescription": "A festive bundle of 6 cute Christmas charms, featuring a reindeer, Santa, Christmas tree, gingerbread house, snowman and Christmas bell. Each design includes a built-in hanging loop, making them perfect for Christmas tree ornaments, gift tags, garlands, decorations and small holiday gifts.\n\nPrint them at your preferred size and create a whole collection for the holidays!\n\nThis is a digital STL download – no physical item will be shipped.\n\n3D printing settings\nSettings may vary depending on your printer, filament and chosen size.\n\nWant the multiple color look from the photos?\n– Paint or spray the finished print with acrylic paint\n– Use the paint tool in your slicer\n– Use multi-color printing or manual filament swaps\n\nDetails are slightly raised to make coloring easier.",
